{"unit_id":"mengwEX__dsh-block-ptc#card-1","repo":"mengwEX/dsh-block-ptc","commit":"c2afa0a0a34990aa7189ea6df377cd215e29f8d6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-block-ptc 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的 PTC 上下文管理插件。它添加 Block PTC 预设，要求每次 run_code 调用在描述中标明任务块；模型可在程序内调用 block_compact，把不再需要的连续会话区间替换为自己撰写的交接内容。它保留其他任务块的成员关系，等待未完成工具结果，并拒绝包含受保护消息的替换。适合希望按任务整理 agent 会话上下文的 DSH 用户；需要 DSH、Cordis 和 Node.js。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:12-17","lib/plugin.js:244-310","lib/blocks.js:98-133"]}
{"unit_id":"mengwEX__dsh-block-ptc#card-2","repo":"mengwEX/dsh-block-ptc","commit":"c2afa0a0a34990aa7189ea6df377cd215e29f8d6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-block-ptc organizes DeepSeek Harness PTC context by task. Its Block PTC preset tags run_code work with block IDs; the model can call block_compact inside a program to replace completed work with a handover summary. Pending tools are awaited and protected messages are preserved.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:12-17","lib/plugin.js:244-310"]}
