{"unit_id":"mengwEX__dsh-block-ptc#feature-1","repo":"mengwEX/dsh-block-ptc","commit":"c2afa0a0a34990aa7189ea6df377cd215e29f8d6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-block-ptc 的功能「按任务标记程序调用」：每次 run_code 的描述以块 ID 和目标开头，插件将这些 ID 关联到整条助手消息及工具结果。模型可重复使用 ID 表示同一项工作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/blocks.js:15-21","lib/blocks.js:50-75"]}
{"unit_id":"mengwEX__dsh-block-ptc#feature-2","repo":"mengwEX/dsh-block-ptc","commit":"c2afa0a0a34990aa7189ea6df377cd215e29f8d6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-block-ptc 的功能「整理并替换上下文区间」：模型在程序中调用 block_compact({ ids, content })，提交自己编写的保留内容，插件将目标块首次至末次出现之间的完整可替换区间换成摘要检查点。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.js:255-310","lib/blocks.js:98-133"]}
{"unit_id":"mengwEX__dsh-block-ptc#feature-3","repo":"mengwEX/dsh-block-ptc","commit":"c2afa0a0a34990aa7189ea6df377cd215e29f8d6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-block-ptc 的功能「保留其他任务块」：替换内容继承区间内未关闭的块 ID，因此摘要仍可参与后续整理；没有剩余成员的检查点也会保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/blocks.js:125-133","lib/plugin.js:159-177"]}
{"unit_id":"mengwEX__dsh-block-ptc#feature-4","repo":"mengwEX/dsh-block-ptc","commit":"c2afa0a0a34990aa7189ea6df377cd215e29f8d6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-block-ptc 的功能「等待工具结果后完成整理」：目标区间含尚未结束的工具调用时，block_compact 返回待处理状态；会话事件回调在工具结果落地后继续尝试提交。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/blocks.js:76-95","lib/plugin.js:180-195","lib/plugin.js:213-228","lib/plugin.js:303-305"]}
{"unit_id":"mengwEX__dsh-block-ptc#feature-5","repo":"mengwEX/dsh-block-ptc","commit":"c2afa0a0a34990aa7189ea6df377cd215e29f8d6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-block-ptc 的功能「检查完整区间再替换」：插件拒绝包含系统或开发者消息、缺失块 ID 或尚未配对工具结果的区间，也会拒绝摘要写好后又到达新用户消息的旧请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/blocks.js:103-124"]}
